    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Energy back; weight down 2.4 kg by intention</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Trouble hearing in noisy rooms, unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dry cough on cold mornings, fading; no breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No bleeding, change in bowel habit or indigestion</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Gets up once at night to pass urine; no hesitancy</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mild knee stiffness after hills; no joint swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new skin lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness, weakness or headaches</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 0</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
