    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 25 minutes, with his consent. He named a health care agent and completed a health care proxy form; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. Because he will be beyond the reach of hospital care for months at a time, he talked through what he would want if he became seriously ill in the ice: care by the ship&apos;s surgeons with the medicines on board, relief of pain and breathlessness, and no attempt at a journey that would endanger others to move him. He asked that a copy of his wishes travel with his medical record on board. The plan will be revisited on his return or after any serious illness. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
